vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-5{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-5{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}-5\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -20\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+0+0 \\\\ 5+0-9 \\\\ -2-20+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -19\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{1} &=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275383 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f767d9b-3d4e-520a-b769-f05609c5dfc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} {:answer/id #uuid "ec3f999c-abdd-5a87-9204-4b13bfc2361d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449751}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c0d7ec0-7274-56ea-8e17-5dc902e217cf" :answer-field/key "$-{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+5{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450829} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c2d0dc78-91a3-5567-80a0-214fb535e9ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449752} {:answer/id #uuid "7ce350bd-6e6f-54e0-816d-4d9658486f5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449753}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186449753} :answer-field/id #uuid "1e6ab5e6-2163-5059-b629-4a9cdb0438ae" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450830} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "600ee484-c8fb-5632-bd7d-a01ccab65fb0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449754} {:answer/id #uuid "59b8d6b2-3c00-5485-ba17-2f8c3aead6f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449755}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186449754} :answer-field/id #uuid "deb701d3-fb26-5305-8568-d564a14ef228" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450831}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "40a86374-09c1-5fcd-a58c-a5f678fb3c1d" :question/math-academy-id "q-157228" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $-{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+5{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+5{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+5\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ 20 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2+0+15 \\\\ -7-10+20 \\\\ 0+0+5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 7{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}7{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275384 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb3566f6-5648-5ded-a3f6-a1f68bddbb41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449756} {:answer/id #uuid "dc5d08b2-9024-5b11-99ac-9eb20963ee53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449757}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186449757} :answer-field/id #uuid "e73a4373-d621-5f35-a808-178c8861a82d" :answer-field/key "${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450832} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "39303f9a-ace3-5e34-bf37-934e599096fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449758} {:answer/id #uuid "1472f8c2-9b6a-5097-9017-33f0242406ec