ook at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-3+4 \\\\ 5-6+1 \\\\ 2-12+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Since statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}={x}_{3}=1$ and ${x}_{2}=-3.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275385 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2254be2b-f993-5682-a9c7-9d6c1aa8a420" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449762} {:answer/id #uuid "b8837dad-34d4-5dd1-84f6-3b476d98748a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449763}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 1